@startuml reader-modules
title Grammar-first map reader: modules and the files between them (contract D3, 2026-09-18)

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "lattice.py" as L
component "legend.py" as G
component "cells.py" as C
component "structure.py" as S
component "chain2catalogue.py\nassemble.py\nhexsheet2svg.py" as A
component "compare.py" as R
component "editor (task 16)" as E

file "scan" as scan
file "lattice.json" as lat
file "legend/vocabulary.json\nlegend/swatch-NN.jpg" as voc
file "library/index.json" as lib
file "cells.json" as cells
file "terrain.json\n<kind>.json chains\nregions.json\nplaces.json\ndoubts.json" as struct
file "sheet.xml (structure)\nstyle declarations" as sheet
file "sheet.png\ndiff.png\nroundtrip.txt" as out

scan --> L
L --> lat
scan --> G
lat --> G
lib --> G
G --> voc
scan --> C
lat --> C
voc --> C
C --> cells
cells --> S
voc --> S
S --> struct
struct --> A
voc --> A
A --> sheet
sheet --> R
scan --> R
R --> out
R ..> C : reads the render back\n(round trip)
struct --> E
sheet --> E
E --> sheet : saves XSD-valid structure

note right of L
  the only module that sees the whole scan;
  one look by a person at its overlay
end note
note right of G
  the only module that uses a model:
  one look to name the swatches
end note
note bottom of S
  priors rank, never invent:
  no cell is written without a score
end note
@enduml
